@startuml
[*] --> UserInput
UserInput --> AnalyzeQuery : User enters search query
AnalyzeQuery --> RetrieveSearchHistory : Analyze query using NLP/ML
RetrieveSearchHistory --> GenerateSuggestions : Retrieve user history/preferences
GenerateSuggestions --> DisplayResults : Generate personalized suggestions
DisplayResults --> [*] : Display results to user
@enduml
